      "mulaIast": "nanu- pariṇamamānāvidyādhiṣṭhānatvenopādānatvaṃ vācyam, adhiṣṭhānatvaṃ tu nāvedyasya, tadvedanārthaṃ pramāṇāpekṣāyāmanyonyāśrayāt | na ca- svaprakāśatadapekṣamevādhiṣṭhānatvamitivācyam, svaprakāśatāyā vaktumaśakyatvāt | tathā hi- kimidaṃ svaprakāśatvaṃ ? vṛttyavyāpyatvaṃ vā ? phalāvyāpyatvaṃ vā ? avedyatve satyaparokṣavyavahāraviṣayatvaṃ vā ? tadyogyatvaṃ vā ? tadyogyatvātyantābhāvānadhikaraṇatvaṃ vā ? nādyaḥ, brahmaṇo'pyāvaraṇabhaṅgāya caramavṛttivyāpyatvāt | na dvitīyaḥ, atītādau nityātīndraye cātivyāpteḥ | na tṛtīyaḥ, suṣuptyādau vyavahārābhāvenāvyāpteḥ | na caturthaḥ, yogyatvarūpadharmasya mokṣakāle'bhāvena tadā brahmaṇyavyāpteḥ | nāpi pañcamaḥ, anadhikaraṇatvasyāpi dharmatvena mokṣadaśāyāṃ tasyāpyabhāvenāvyāpteḥ | ata eva na tādṛganadhikaraṇatvopalakṣitamapi tat, tasyāpi dharmatve muktāvabhāvāditi cenna, pañcamapakṣasyaiva kṣodasahatvāt | na ca mokṣe'vyāptiḥ, anadhikaraṇatvasya svarūpatayā tadāpi sattvāt | na ca svarūpatve lakṣaṇatvānupapattiḥ, tvannaye brahmābhinnānandādau guṇatvavyavahāravat svarūpabhūte'pyanadhikaraṇatve lakṣaṇatvavyavahārāt | na ca- tvanmate yogyatvamapi brahmaṇi mithyeti tadatyantābhāvo'pi vācyaḥ, tathā ca kathaṃ tadatyantābhāvānadhikaraṇatvamitivācyam, yogyatvavirodhyatyantābhāvasya vivakṣitatvāt, svāśrayaniṣṭhātyantābhāvasya mithyātvaprayojakasya svāśrayaniṣṭhatvenaivāvirodhitvāt | yadvā- vyāvahārikātyantābhāvo vivakṣitaḥ, brahmaṇi ca yogyatātyantābhāvasya brahmasvarūpatvena tāttvikatvāt |\n\nnāpyavedyatvāniruktiḥ, phalāvyāpyatvasyaiva tattvāt, āvaraṇabhaṅge cita eva phalatvāt | na ca- evaṃ ghaṭāderapi vṛttivedyatayā phalaviṣayatvābhāvād rūpyasukhāderapi aparokṣavyavahārayogyatayā viśiṣṭalakṣaṇasyātivyāptiriti vācyam, ghaṭādau phalavyāpyatvasya samarthitatvādrūpyasukhādau sākṣibhāsyatayā'parokṣavyavahāre'pi pramāṇajanyāparokṣa vṛttiviṣayatvābhāvāt | tathā ca phalāvyāpyatvasamānādhikaraṇatadvattvasya paryavasitatayā sakaladoṣanirāsāt | na ca brahmaṇo'pi vṛttipratibimbitacidrūpaphalabhāsyatvenāsaṃbhavaḥ, tasya phalarūpatvena tadviṣayatvābhāvāt | na ca citsukhācāryaiḥ tatsvabhāvasyāpi sphuraṇasya tadviṣayatvamityukterasaṃbhavaḥ, tasyācāryavacasastatprayuktavyavahāraviṣayatayā tadviṣayatvopacāranibandhanatvāt | ayamatra niṣkarṣaḥ-vṛttipratibimbitacijjanyātiśayayogitvaṃ vṛttyā tatpratiphalitacitā vā abhivyaktādhiṣṭhānacidviṣayatvaṃ vā phalavyāpyatvam | cijjanyātiśayaśca nāvaraṇabhaṅgaḥ, nāpi vyavahāro vivakṣitaḥ, kintu bhagnāvaraṇacitsaṃbandhaḥ | sa ca ghaṭādāvasti, nātmani, saṃbandhasya bhedagarbhatvāt | evamuktacidviṣayatvamapi bhedaghaṭitaṃ ghaṭādāvasti, nātmanīti sthitaṃ pratikarmavyavasthāyām | nāpyaparokṣa vyāvahāro durvacaḥ aparokṣa iti śabdaprayogasyaiva vivakṣitatvāt | na cālaukikapratyakṣaviṣayadharmādharmādau tādṛśavyavahārayogitayā ativyāptiḥ, yogajadharmātiriktālaukikapratyāsatteranaṅgīkārāt, tasyāpi svayogyavyavahita eva sāmarthyāpādakatvāt, na tu dharmādau | taduktaṃ `yatrāpyatiśayo dṛṣṭa' ityādi | etena- kaścāyamaparokṣavyavahāro nāma ? aparokṣajñānajanyo vā ? aparokṣavastuviṣayo vā ? aparokṣa ityākāro vā ? nādyaḥ, dharmādāvapyaparokṣayogijñānānuvyavasāyavyāptijñānajanyavyavahārasattvenātivyāpteḥ, na dvitīyaḥ, vastuna āparokṣyam aparokṣajñānaviṣayatvaṃ cet, ātmano'pi ghaṭādivad vedyatvāpātāt | aparokṣavyavahāraviṣayatvaṃ cet, vastuvyavahārayorāparokṣye anyonyasāpekṣatayā'nyonyāśrayāt | na tṛtīyaḥ, nirākāraśuddhabrahmaviṣayasyākhaṇḍārthaniṣṭhavedānta janyavyavahārasyāparokṣa ityākārāyogāditinirastam, vyavahārapadenābhivadanasya vivakṣitatvena caramavṛttestadanākāratve'pi kṣatyabhāvāt | na cānupalabdhigamyatayā avedye aparokṣe lokavyavahārasattvenābhāve'tivyāptiḥ, prāmāṇikavyavahārasya vivakṣitatvāt |\n\nnanu- aparokṣavyavahārayogyatvaṃ na tāvatsarvān prati, caitrājñāne maitrasya tadabhāvāt | nāpi jñānaṃ prati, tasyāvyavahartṛtvāt | nāpi jñānāśrayaṃ prati, jñānasya cito'nāśritatvāditi- cenna, pramātāraṃ yaṃ kañcit pratyevāparokṣavyavahārayogyatvaṃ vivakṣitam | pramātā cāhamartha eva sarvasaṃmataḥ | yattūktaṃ caitrasya jñāne maitrasyāvyavahāra iti, tasya caitrajñānanimittako maitrasyāvyavahāra iti vārthaḥ ? caitrajñānaviṣayako maitrasyāvyavahāra iti vārthaḥ ? ādye caitrajñānena maitrasyāvyavahāre'pi svajñānenaiva ghaṭe brahmaṇi cāparokṣavyavahārasaṃbhavena vyarthaviśeṣaṇatvāsaṃbhavayorabhāvāt | dvitīye caitrajñāne tādṛgvyavahārābhāve'pi kṣatyabhāvāt | asmākamapi hi citireva svaprakāśā, na tu caitra jñānatvena vyapadiśyamānavṛttyupahitacidapi, vṛtterasvaprakāśatvāt | evaṃ ca sarvapramātṝn prati tādṛgvyavahāraviṣayatāyogyatvamapi saṅgacchata eva | nanu- avedyatve satyaparokṣa vyavahāraviṣayatvaṃ tadyogyatvaṃ ca vyāhatam, tadaparokṣavyavahāre tadviṣayakasphuraṇasya hetutvāditi cenna, anyatra tadviṣayasya tadvyavahārajanakatve'pi sphuraṇasya svāviṣayasya svasmin vyavahārajanakatvam, svabhāvabhedāt | na ca ghaṭādāvapi tathaivāstu, teṣāmasphuraṇarūpatvena tadviṣayatvaṃ vinā niyāmakāntarābhāvāt, tārkikakalpitasyānuvyavasāyasyāpi ghaṭajñānajñānatvāpekṣayā laghunā ghaṭajñānatvenaiva ghaṭajñānavyavahārahetutvakalpanācca |\n\nnanu- anavasthābhiyā sphuraṇāntarānaṅgīkārāt svasyasvaviṣayatvamastu, anyatra klṛptasya tadviṣayatvasya niyāmakasya tyaktumayuktatvād, anyathā prameyatvasya svavṛttitvaṃ vinaiva svata eva prameyamiti vyavahārajanakatvopapattyā kevalānvayitvabhaṅgaprasaṅga iti cenna, anavasthayā sphuraṇāntaratyāgavadabhede bhedaniyatasya viṣayiviṣayabhāvasyāpyayuktatayā tyāgopapatteḥ, prameyatvādau kevalānvayitvabhaṅgasyeṣṭatvāt | na ca- evaṃ gatirapi grāma iva svasminnapi svakāryaṃ karotviti vācyam, bhedāviśeṣāttanturiva mṛdapi paṭaṃ karotvityasyāpyāpatteḥ | svabhāvabhedena parihāraśca sarvatra samānaḥ |"
